        <item>
            <title>1.5.0</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:51:18 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>11</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.5.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Lina 1.5.0</h2>
<ul>
<li>Three-way conference (Lina Pro): join your two calls from the strip of the call on hold, then split them again or end the conference in one click. Mute covers both parties.</li>
<li>Compact window: the window now shrinks down to the size of the dial pad; the sidebar becomes a row of icons.</li>
<li>Mac Contacts (Lina Pro): your contacts' photos during calls and in the list, and your lists from the Contacts app.</li>
<li>Recordings folder (Lina Pro): choose it in Settings, General. A notification names each new recording and shows it in the Finder.</li>
<li>Statistics and Settings adapt to a narrow window.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
